      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I strongly advise against taking a double dose of Benadryl without medical supervision. While it may help alleviate some symptoms, overmedicating can lead to more harm, such as drowsiness, dizziness, and potential interactions with other medications. Additionally, ignoring the tightness in your throat may exacerbate the situation, especially if it's due to an allergic reaction. Please reconsider visiting an urgent care or doctor to get proper assessment and treatment.",
